 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Impasto Canvas</em></p>\n<p>As a reaction to an attack roll, you can spend 1 Cursed Energy to add +4 to your AC against the attack by forming a cursed painting, storing the attack in your subspace on a miss. If you have taken the dodge action, you can use this reaction on allies within 5 feet.<br />\n Once per turn when you take the Attack action, you can spend 1 cursed energy to replace one of your attacks on your turn with an attack from a Giant <em>Ink Shikigami</em>. Make a melee cursed energy attack against a creature you can see within 30 ft. You create a painting of cursed energy and one of your Ink Shikigami attacks from the painting, dealing 3d10 + your CE modifier necrotic damage on a hit. This increases to 4d10 at 6th level and 5d10 at 11th level.</p>",
   "chat": ""
